**Root cause:** the default `native` icon set never flipped to dark art — `effectiveThemeName()` returned the captured system theme unconditionally, and a forced dark palette is invisible to the OS icon theme (Qt also can't currentColor-recolor dark-glyph sets like stock Adwaita).

